G'day all! I love your suuggestions for Nethack. I have the code 
myself, and am thinking of writing my own things for it. Has anyone
here ever written anything for it? If so, please mail me.

  I _love_ the telephone idea. But there is one drawback. It seems
from what I've seen of the code, that shops are not generated until
you arrive at their level. So a phone booth on level 5 couldn't 
predict shops on level >6

   Sn idea of my own, that I was thinking of implementing, was a
food dispensing machine. You know, insert 50 zorkmids and get a 
candy bar, or a pizza or even a tripe ration (no REAL food, this
is a JUNK FOOD MACHINE!)

  I was also thinking of adding a real fireball wand, like Moria.
So that, when the fireball hits a monster, it explodes doing damage
to everything in a 4 square radius or so. 

    I've got many more ideas, but I'd really like to hear yours...

